direction: down

tick: membership tick (leader only,\nevery 2 min, first after 3 min)
status: read /status and /nodes once
notleader: not Leader:\nreturn, no work
term: noteTerm: record the term;\nstable = unchanged on 3 ticks
dead: evictDeadVoters:\nvoter unreachable for 10 ticks?\n(deferred while the term is unstable)
gates: all must hold:\n1 safeToEvict (quorum survives)\n2 discovery forgot the address (2 h)\n3 two observers recorded dead in 30 min
tomb: write tombstone\nin raft_evicted_nodes
rm: DELETE /remove
one: one change made:\nend of tick
rec: reconcileVoters:\nmore than 5 members?
quorum: live quorum of voters?\nterm stable?
fix: fix one mismatch:\ndemote excess voter or promote\nvia POST /join with voter flag

tick -> status
status -> notleader
status -> term
term -> dead
dead -> gates: expired candidate
gates -> tomb
tomb -> rm
rm -> one
dead -> rec: none expired
gates -> rec: a gate refuses: next candidate;\nfailed corroboration holds it off 10 min
rec -> quorum: yes
quorum -> fix
